   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2024, FCDO pledged an annual contribution to the DREF for 2024. BRC and FCDO signed a Memorandum of Understanding for the annual payment of 1.5million (&#xa3;), with a 1% admin fee of &#xa3;15,000. This was retained by BRC, a total of &#xa3;1,485,000 was paid to IFRC DREF. Following recent correspondence, FCDO proposed to increase the amount made available to BRC by &#xa3;5,400,000 (Five million four hundred thousand pounds sterling). FCDO and BRC have agreed to continue the annual contributions and signed a Memorandum of Understanding Amendment Letter, attached. Payments will be made in two tranches for the periods: 01 Apr 2024 &#x2013; 31 Mar 2025 (2,673,000, after admin fee), and 01 Apr 2025 &#x2013; 31 Mar 2026, (2,673,000, after admin fee). This payment is the first of the two tranches, and will be considered by IFRC as spent.
This payment request was initially processed with signed GAD Addendum 1, and withdrawn. The document had an error on a historic figure. Finance requested for audit purposes, that this be changed. This change has been reflected in Addendum 2. There are no changes to the total and the time period set out in GAD Addendum 2, from GAD Addendum 1. For further information, please review the Archive folder under GAD Addendum in the grant page. This process has also been reflected in GAD Addendum 2, on page 3.
The payment total is 2,673,000, and the spend timeframe is&#xa0;01 Jan 2025 &#x2013; 31 Dec 2025.</narrative>
   </description>
